1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,100
JULIANA: If I stop now, I will think about everything I lost.

2
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:19,700
MYSTERIOUS BEARDED MAN: There.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,500
MYSTERIOUS BEARDED MAN: It is not much.

4
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:26,100
JULIANA: It is enough for tonight.

5
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,300
JULIANA: I lost my home today.

6
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:31,700
JULIANA: My family.

7
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:34,700
JULIANA: Everything I thought my life would be.

8
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:35,900
JULIANA: And yet...

9
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:38,900
JULIANA: Sitting here with him, I don't feel afraid.
